    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAs">IV As</ref> 6.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Si episcopum vel comitem vel abbatem vel aldermannum vel thainum requirat, habeat terminum tres noctes; et quærat quicquid quærat, non habeat vitam diucius, si capiatur.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he seeks a bishop or a nobleman, an abbot an ealdorman or a thegn, he shall have a respite for three days. But let him seek whatever he may, he shall not be spared longer, if he is caught.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
